# Content

- Rooms, items, NPCs, spells, quests, and help text stay declarative.
- Use stable IDs. Do not casually rename released IDs.
- All public names and descriptions must be original or licensed.
- Reject HTML, scripts, and student personal information.
- Invalid content should fail validation rather than load silently.
